Package: clobe
Title: Global Benchmark and Evaluation Tools for Formal Computational Models
Version: 0.8.0
Date: 2026-10-14
Authors@R: c(person("Lenard", "Dome",
                   email = "lenarddome@gmail.com",
                   role = c("aut", "cre")),
             person("Andy", "Wills", role = c("aut")))
Description: Implements the tools used for the comparison of human and model
    heterogeneity (Dome and Wills, 2025) <doi:10.1037/rev0000550>: inequality
    matrices, g-distance, and the counting and enumeration of the ordinal
    patterns (semiorders and weak orderings) that make up the universal set.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/lenarddome/clobe
BugReports: https://github.com/lenarddome/clobe/issues
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.9), RcppParallel (>= 5.1.0)
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo, RcppParallel
SystemRequirements: GNU make
Encoding: UTF-8
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
